                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 14pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;">
</p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为助力新入职教师快速适应角色、提升育人能力，锻造一支高素质、专业化、创新型的新生力量</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">8月19日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，绍兴一中教育集团第二期新教师培训在龙山书院正式拉开帷幕。本次培训内容聚焦</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">开学第一课</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，旨在通过系统化、闭环式的精准实训，确保新教师们以最佳状态迎接新学期，为学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">赢在起点</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">奠定坚实基础。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842257387.Jpeg" style="width: 5.757639in; height: 3.921528in" alt="202508300842253765.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">本次培训面向集团内刚毕业的新入职教师，为期四天。集团领导高度重视，教科室、教学处</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">德育处</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">等多部门协同精心策划，培训内容紧密围绕</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">先研后教、以评促教</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的核心思路，涵盖了教学理念、课堂实操、德育故事、角色转型等多个维度，力求实效。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>首日培训：高屋建瓴，启思导行</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">培训首日，活动安排紧凑而充实。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教科室副主任赵正瑜老师简明扼要地介绍了本期培训的整体框架、目标要求及日程安排，并现场收集了新教师的档案信息，为后续个性化指导与跟踪培养做好了前期准备。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842251452.Jpeg" style="width: 2.925694in; height: 2.245139in" alt="202508300842254075.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">随后，教学处主任祝智浩老师带来了题为《如何上好一堂课》的专题讲座。祝主任从课堂教学的核心要素出发，深入浅出地阐述了目标设定、环节设计、互动生成、效果达成的关键方法与技巧，为新教师们提供了清晰实用的课堂教学行动指南，帮助他们初步构建起对</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">高质量课堂</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的认知框架。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842257597.Jpeg" style="width: 2.743056in; height: 1.999306in" alt="202508300842256936.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">资深名优班主任陈雪萍老师的分享则充满了教育的温度与智慧。她以</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">我的德育故事</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为线索，生动讲述了如何将德育无痕融入日常教学与管理之中，引导新教师们深刻理解</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教育工作者</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">相较于</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">学科老师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">更丰富的内涵与责任，助力他们顺利完成从毕业生到育人者的角色转变与心态升级。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842251798.Jpeg" style="width: 2.275in; height: 1.655556in" alt="202508300842252204.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><a style="text-decoration: none;"></a><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">上午的压轴环节和下午的议程均由校领导带来重要讲话。冯王亮副校长、杨佩琼副校长和蒋明校长深情回顾了各自的教育成长历程，以前辈和引路人的身份，从不同维度对新教师们提出了殷切期望，并给予了具体而深刻的工作指引。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">冯王亮副校长立足教育教学常规，为新教师的专业发展夯实基础。他从备课、做题、课件制作等教学基本功，到班主任工作的职责与艺术，再到如何协调与老教师的关系等方面，提出了详尽的要求并分享了宝贵的个人建议，为新人顺利度过适应期提供了清晰的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">行动指南</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842255086.Jpeg" style="width: 3.120833in; height: 2.252778in" alt="202508300842256099.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">杨佩琼副校长的讲话则充满了教育的温度与情怀。她以</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">捧着一颗心来，不带半根草去</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的无私精神为核心，结合自身的动人经历，深入浅出地分享了</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">如何将德育无缝浸润于课堂</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的宝贵经验。她强调，真正的德育并非空洞说教，而在于</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">心上用功、事上磨砺</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，鼓励新教师们在内省与实践中修炼育人本领，完成从</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">经师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">到</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">人师</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的升华。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842255979.Jpeg" style="width: 3.414583in; height: 2.566667in" alt="202508300842258745.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">蒋明校长的讲话高屋建瓴，着重提醒新教师们把握工作中的关键原则。他强调，要</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">了解学生、认识学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，这是所有教育行为的起点；务必</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">公平公正地处理学生事件</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，守护校园的公平正义；要时刻</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">做好模范带头作用</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，以身立教；遇到问题应</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">多向老教师学习、多向组织寻求帮助</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，善用集体智慧；同时必须</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">多多关注家校沟通</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，凝聚育人合力。这番语重心长的叮嘱，为新教师们规避常见误区、走稳职业道路指明了方向。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842253478.Jpeg" style="width: 3.18125in; height: 2.459028in" alt="202508300842258462.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">三位校领导的讲话既有理论高度，又极富实践指导意义</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">既强调了坚守教育初心、落实立德树人根本任务的重要性，也就学校发展规划、教育教学改革趋势、教师专业成长路径等方面进行了宏观指导与动员，极大地鼓舞了新教师的士气，激发了他们的职业荣誉感与使命感</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为他们系好了职业生涯的</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">第一粒扣子</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>沉浸实践：观摩反思</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>模拟淬炼</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">20日</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">至22日上</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">午是沉浸式实践阶段。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">为</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">确保每位新教师在开学第一周即能自信地站上讲台，呈现</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">目标精准、流程顺畅、评价到位、德育润心</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">”</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">的高质量课堂</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，本次培训引入了“</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">教学</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">听课”和“模拟上课”环节。</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师们深入课堂一线，认真听课、细致记录、深刻反思，将理论知识与真实教学场景相印证，不断内化吸收。同时，他们全力以赴投入《开学第一课》的模拟上课准备中，精心设计教学环节、制作课件、构思板书，在学科组内相互切磋，反复打磨。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>成果检阅：模拟上课</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>专业点评</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">22</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">日下午的模拟上课环节将培训推向高潮。新教师们依次登台，进行无学生</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">版</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">模拟授课。他们教态自然</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">、</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">表达清晰，教学设计各具特色，充分展现了四天来的学习成果与个人潜能。各学科</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专家</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">认真观课，并从教学目标、内容处理、流程设计、方法运用、板书设计、教师素养以及前期听课反思情况等方面进行了精准、深入的点评，既肯定了优点，也指出了提升方向，并填写了专业的《课堂教学评估表》。这不仅是一次考核，更是一次宝贵的、直面问题的专业指导会。</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842253356.Jpeg" style="width: 2.496528in; height: 1.873611in" alt="202508300842257835.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842254575.Jpeg" style="width: 2.509722in; height: 1.882639in" alt="202508300842250890.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842251323.Jpeg" style="width: 2.468055in; height: 1.851389in" alt="202508300842250789.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842250742.Jpeg" style="width: 2.565278in; height: 1.924306in" alt="202508300842254067.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师模拟上课</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842266334.Jpeg" style="width: 2.773611in; height: 2.08125in" alt="202508300842262116.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842269652.Jpeg" style="width: 2.759028in; height: 2.069444in" alt="202508300842262757.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842266864.Jpeg" style="width: 2.604167in; height: 1.953472in" alt="202508300842266016.Jpeg" /></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842267762.Jpeg" style="width: 2.6375in; height: 1.978472in" alt="202508300842266002.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><img src="\UploadFiles\xwzx\2025\8\202508300842263097.Jpeg" style="width: 2.498611in; height: 1.873611in" alt="202508300842264773.Jpeg" /></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">专家指导</span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>圆满收官：征程启航</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>，</strong></span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"><strong>淬火成钢</strong></span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">通过</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">此次培训</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">，</span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">新教师们普遍感到受益匪浅，不仅快速熟悉了学校环境与教学要求，更在实战演练中提升了教学技能，坚定了职业信念。他们表示，将以此次培训为起点，持续学习，不断反思，努力成长为一名卓越的人民教师。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">绍兴一中教育集团始终将教师队伍建设作为发展的核心动力。此次系统化的入职培训，不仅是绍兴一中教育集团加强教师队伍建设、夯实发展后劲的关键举措，更彰显了集团对卓越教育品质的不懈追求和对新教师专业成长的高度负责。期待新教师们在此次培训中淬火成钢，蓄满能量，在金秋九月，与学生们共同开启一段精彩的教育之旅。 </span></p><p style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;"> </span></p><p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';font-size: 10.5pt;line-height: 108%;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;margin-right: 0;margin-top: 0;text-align: right;text-indent: 0.29in;"><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">                                                  </span><span style="font-family: Calibri;font-size: 10.5pt;margin: 0;padding: 0;">       </span></p>
    
